# Agent session exports. These transcripts routinely contain secrets pasted
# mid-conversation (router/gateway admin passwords, API tokens) and land in the
# repo root, one `git add -A` away from being committed. Ignore them by pattern
# rather than relying on noticing each one.
*-export-session*.md
